flowchart LR
    data[(Dataset)] --> split{Split}
    split -->|80%| train[Train]
    split -->|10%| val[Validate]
    split -->|10%| test[Test]
    train --> model[Model]
    model --> val
    val -->|tune| train
    model --> test --> report[Metrics report]
    report --> ship{Good enough?}
    ship -->|yes| registry[(Model registry)]
    ship -->|no| data
